      {
        "id": 228475,
        "name": "aramis",
        "username": "aramis",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/aramis/{size}/1871_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-08-13T21:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There’s also the issue that the average damage for any of the dice used (d4, d6, d8, d10, d12) will NOT be an integer.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Expected tries to kill [table] [tr][td]AtkDie↓ Lt Die→[/td][td]d4[/td][td]d6[/td][td]d8[/td][td]d10[/td][td]d12[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d4[/td][td]2.67[/td][td]6.67[/td][td]12.00[/td][td]18.67[/td][td]26.67[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d6[/td][td]4.80[/td][td]12.00[/td][td]21.60[/td][td]33.60[/td][td]48.00[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d8[/td][td]4.57[/td][td]11.43[/td][td]20.57[/td][td]32.00[/td][td]45.71[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d10[/td][td]2.67[/td][td]6.00[/td][td]10.44[/td][td]16.00[/td][td]22.67[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d12[/td][td]2.09[/td][td]4.49[/td][td]7.40[/td][td]11.03[/td][td]15.40[/td][/tr][/table]</p>\n<p>I worked this out by count-table rather than pure formula. (makes it easier to replicate the rules - damage die ≤&nbsp; lieutenant die is no drop).</p>\n<p>The OP’s data looks closer to expected tries to step-down…</p>\n<p>[table] Expected tries to stepdown [tr][td]AtkDie↓ Lt Die→[/td][td]d4[/td][td]d6[/td][td]d8[/td][td]d10[/td][td]d12[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d4[/td][td]2.67[/td][td]4.00[/td][td]5.33[/td][td]6.67[/td][td]8.00[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d6[/td][td]4.80[/td][td]7.20[/td][td]9.60[/td][td]12.00[/td][td]14.40[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d8[/td][td]4.57[/td][td]6.86[/td][td]9.14[/td][td]11.43[/td][td]13.71[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d10[/td][td]2.67[/td][td]3.33[/td][td]4.44[/td][td]5.56[/td][td]6.67[/td][/tr] [tr][td]d12[/td][td]2.09[/td][td]2.40[/td][td]2.91[/td][td]3.64[/td][td]4.36[/td][/tr][/table]</p>\n<p>Worksheet: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Y9UYSxj8k2RmS7Z98UbCrqFVmVLBeV7R8og76fwiPrI/edit?usp=sharing\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Sentinel Comics Lieutenants - Google Sheets</a></p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:58.449Z",
